n Now in Public Preview</a> (Steef-Jan Wiggers)</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://www.mssqltips.com/sqlservertip/7472/sql-deadlock-priority-roll-back-transaction/\">Setting SQL Deadlock Priority to Control the Transaction that is Rolled Back</a> (Sergey Gigoyan)</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://www.brentozar.com/archive/2022/11/slow-having-query-try-pre-filtering/\">Slow “Having” Query? Try Pre-Filtering.</a> (Brent Ozar)</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://www.sqlservercentral.com/blogs/encrypting-your-sql-data-should-be-your-default-option\">Encrypting Your SQL Data Should be Your Default Option</a> (Matthew McGiffen)</li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<h3>\n<a></a>Miscellaneous</h3>\n<ul><li>\n<a href=\"https://samestuffdifferentday.net/2022/11/29/things-i-learned-11/\">Things I Learned #11: Zsh, Spotify, and more</a> (Michael Eaton)</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://yro.slashdot.org/story/22/11/29/2148250/ankers-eufy-cameras-caught-uploading-content-to-the-cloud-without-user-consent?utm_source=rss1.0mainlinkanon&amp;utm_medium=feed\">Anker’s Eufy Cameras Caught Uploading Content To the Cloud Without User Consent</a> (BeauHD)</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/2022/11/29/23483836/twitter-covid-misinformation-policy-enforcement-end\">Twitter has stopped enforcing its covid misinformation policies</a> (Emma Roth)</li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<h3>\n<a></a>More Link Collections</h3>\n<ul><li>\n<a href=\"https://blog.cwa.me.uk/2022/11/30/the-morning-brew-3597/\">The Morning Brew #3597</a> (Chris Alcock)</li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<h3>\n<a></a>The Geek Shelf</h3>\n<p align=\"left\"><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/1800208669/?tag=amavin-20\"><img align=\"left\" style=\"margin:0px 4px 0px 0px;border:0px;float:left;background-image:none;\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Z9lMC71WL._SS135_.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"41Z9lMC71WL._SS135_.jpg\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/1800208669/?tag=amavin-20\">Learn WinUI 3</a> (Alvin Ashcraft)<em> – Referral Link</em></p>",
